{"id":"vod_zy360_67597","vodId":"67597","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士加布[普通话版]","name_cn":"假面骑士加布[普通话版]","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全50集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241104-1/4d5e91be9a6758d313d6f48191702a00.jpg"},"summary":"在人类世界里暗中行动的智慧生物——砂糖人。他们为了获取“黑暗零食”持续掳掠人类。接连不断有人类遭到砂糖人袭击，从异世界而来的青年生真，为了拯救人类挺身而出。饱藏，是生真吃下零食后产出的小巧怪物。生真与它们一起，用形似嘴巴的腰带变身为假面骑士加布……！软糖、薯片、棉花糖、巧克力、糖果……用零食之力实现强化，保护人类不受怪物砂糖人侵害！“零食”英雄——假面骑士加布的战斗即将拉开序幕！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,科幻,日本动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-09-01 11:00:44","episodeCount":50,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/jy9RQbJs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/iNS3n70i/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/PodJqxM2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/Gxqf2owT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/szAGoyiB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/7TezS6bu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/lGTexHzg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/uUTZleCm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/7krrtfHH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250406/BawluVAZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250406/kzKGVmCv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250406/Ph6SRUfM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250406/NQ4zWe4T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250406/ekIcdEA3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250406/Fkx1vt7X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250406/18rcakbj/index.m3u